slua provides CMake targets:

    find_package(unofficial-slua CONFIG REQUIRED)
    target_link_libraries(main PRIVATE unofficial::slua::Luau.Analysis unofficial::slua::Luau.Compiler)

Headers are under include/slua and are included as Luau/<Name>.h. Luau/LSLCompiler.h
compiles LSL for Luau's VM over Tailslide, the fork's own, which the package
carries: unofficial::slua::libtailslide, its headers included as
<tailslide/tailslide.hh>. Link that one rather than the tailslide port, which
cannot be installed beside it. unofficial::slua::Luau.Require's navigator
(Luau/RequireNavigator.h) walks a require path by Luau's rules over a tool's
own places.
